#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Setup an email alias for your pipeline to directly create leads from emails!"
msgstr ""
"Opret et e-mailalias til din pipeline, så du kan oprette leads direkte fra e-"
"mails!"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Setup the recurring maintenance rules you need per product.<br/>As soon as a "
"serial exceeds the maintenance run-time increment, a recurring maintenance "
"task will be created!"
msgstr ""
"Opret regler for regelmæssig vedligeholdelse, du har brug for, for hvert "
"produkt.<br/>Når et serienummer når det fastsatte vedligeholdelsesinterval, "
"oprettes der automatisk en tilbagevendende vedligeholdelsesopgave!"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Similarly, as soon as a reception check is failed and the serial sent to "
"Maintenance location, a field task for its maintenance is created and ready "
"for technician to fix the issue!"
msgstr ""
"Når en modtagelseskontrol mislykkes, og serienummeret sendes til "
"vedligeholdelsesafdelingen, oprettes der automatisk en "
"vedligeholdelsesopgave, så en tekniker kan udbedre fejlen!"

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM App</strong> capture customer leads and help turn them into "
"contracts with automated workflows."
msgstr ""
"<strong>CRM-appen</strong> registrerer kundekontakter og hjælper med at "
"omdanne dem til kontrakter ved hjælp af automatiserede workflows."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM App</strong> lets you capture leads from multiple sources, "
"track them through a pipeline, and follow up effectively using tasks, notes, "
"and chatter communication."
msgstr ""
"Med <strong>CRM-appen</strong> kan du registrere leads fra forskellige "
"kilder, følge dem gennem salgspipelinen og følge op på dem ved hjælp af "
"opgaver, noter og kommunikation i chatteren."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Field Service App</strong> manages delivery, installation, on-"
"site intervention schedules as well as regular servicing and reduces "
"downtime by planning maintenance cycles."
msgstr ""
"Appen <strong>Udkørende service</strong> håndterer levering, installation, "
"servicebesøg og regelmæssig vedligeholdelse samt reducerer nedetiden ved at "
"planlægge vedligeholdelsescyklusser."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Inventory App</strong> will manage the physical stock of "
"machines, keep track of detailed serial numbers,track usage and returns."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lagerappen</strong> administrerer den fysiske maskinbestand, "
"registrerer detaljerede serienumre og holder styr på brugen og "
"returneringerne."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Invoicing App</strong> supports recurring billing, deposits, "
"late fees, and equipment damage charges."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Faktureringsappen</strong> understøtter tilbagevendende fakturering, "
"depositummer, morarenter og gebyrer for skader på udstyr."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Rental App</strong> is designed for planning, scheduling, and "
"managing rental contracts, with visibility over equipment availability and "
"duration."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Udlejning</strong> bruges til planlægning, tidsstyring og "
"administration af lejekontrakter og giver et overblik over udstyrets "
"tilgængelighed og lejeperioder."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Rental App</strong> will centralize rental contracts, billing "
"cycles, availability, and reservations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Udlejningsappen</strong> samler lejekontrakter, afregningscyklusser, "
"tilgængelighed og reservationer ét sted."

#. module: agri_equipment_rental
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:agri_equipment_rental.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr ""
"De er alle inkluderet i dit nuværende abonnement. Gå straks på opdagelse i "
"dem! 🙃"

